libc++ (LLVM 18) std::views::iota: the bodies of iota_view's __iterator
constructor, __sentinel and operator- are dropped.  A cvise reduction found
one layer (iterator_concept from derived_from on incomplete classes,
cpp11_conversion_between_incomplete_classes, fixed); more remain.  clang++ 18
-stdlib=libc++ accepts this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
